function integer transform() {
    $out.0.id = $in.1.id;
    $out.0.total = $in.1.amount;
    return ALL;
}
```

Our directory audit treats email addresses as equal after trimming and lowercasing. Emit every matched employee with a changed flag and the original new email, not its normalized form.

Yesterday's directory is stream A/input 0; the replacement is stream B/input 1. Configure $employee_id=$employee_id as Join key, sort each input ascending by employee_id, and enforce unique employee IDs upstream. Physical port 1 receives matches; port 0 receives A-only and port 2 B-only. All are connected.

